yVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"R9TBf8VqGQ83kvdIxkC9RQ","review_id":"oseIKy17LcccYxC3wwmIgQ","date":"2020-11-14T01:52:25","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9431805610656738,"text_excerpt":"Dooky Chase is hands-down heaven in a plate. We went there for early morning and were one of the first parties to be sat. We had a larger table and definitely shared a lot of great food. One of my favorites was the shrimp Clemenceau. From the crispy potatoes to tender peas and mushrooms, then the buttery shrimp I would come back to New Orleans just for this dish. I'm very sad that I didn't get to order some of the mac & cheese because my friend literally talked about it all weekend. Apparently it was filled with garlicky goodness. Another can't miss hit was the Fried chicken. It was one of the best things I had. But better not skip out on the gumbo either. I'm basically saying you need to..."},{"business_id":"R9TBf8VqGQ83kvdIxkC9RQ","review_id":"655nzScDvePosdxMI4qmRQ","date":"2018-12-22T16:32:26","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9420515298843384,"text_excerpt":"Some of the best chicken, greens and Mac and cheese. Love each visit we make here. Had a party of 10 last night and the service was good and the food was delivered in a timely manner. My second visit since living in New Orleans and the history is rich and deep at the restaurant. The art work is wonderful. Had the opportunity to meet Mrs Chase last night and too hear a story about Charlie Bolden and for her to express how proud she was of the work I do. Before this experience I loved the food and is a big fan of the restaurant. I recommend making reservations if you know what to eat here, the wait can be an hour or more on Friday nights."},{"business_id":"R9TBf8VqGQ83kvdIxkC9RQ","review_id":"vHkdw8DM5Bc0CsSX9Hyinw","date":"2018-03-07T14:15:03","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9413236379623413,"text_excerpt":"I have been all over this city eating delectable fried chicken & I have found some good spots, but let me tell you, this is THE PLACE to get fried chicken in NOLA. I have eaten here several times & can say that the quality is consistent & delightful. When I first walked in the door, I was greeted with pictures of Barack Obama having a ball at the restaurant. I thought that was fantastic. There's a nice, roomy dining area that is well-lit & adorned with artwork & pretty stained glass pieces. The staff here works their butts off while providing decent service. Once seated, I had the option of ordering from the menu or getting the buffet, which I could easily see & somewhat smell from the se..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"R9TBf8VqGQ83kvdIxkC9RQ","photo_id":"djTRyJURS_CUZ63o2_20rQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/djTRyJURS_CUZ63o2_20rQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8023200035095215},{"business_id":"R9TBf8VqGQ83kvdIxkC9RQ","photo_id":"4T6ZSNMjBElOcjzWadbcYg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/4T6ZSNMjBElOcjzWadbcYg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7893282175064087},{"business_id":"R9TBf8VqGQ83kvdIxkC9RQ","photo_id":"9WfexPycXJYIUPwIJgVxgg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/9WfexPycXJYIUPwIJgVxgg.jpg","visual_representativeness"